<title>USA: TABLE - Roadway Express Q2 net increases.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Roadway Express Q2 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>AKRON, Ohio 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second Quarter</p>
<p>					June 21, 1997     June 15, 1996</p>
<p> Revenue			  $  609,374,000     $  532,749,000</p>
<p> Net Income			    7,767,000	    4,053,000</p>
<p> Net Income Per Share		     0.38		   0.20</p>
<p> Average Shares Outstanding     20,536,000	   20,484,000</p>
<p>						   1st half</p>
<p>					June 21, 1997     June 15, 1996</p>
<p> Revenue			  $1,200,049,000     $1,049,712,000</p>
<p> Net Income			   13,289,000	    6,676,000</p>
<p> Net Income Per Share		     0.65		   0.33</p>
<p> Average Shares Outstanding     20,542,000	   20,520,000</p>
<p>NOTE:  Roadway Express Inc said its second quarter ended June 21.</p>
<p>Earnings per share for the second quarter of 1997 were reduced by $0.03 per share by a pre-tax charge to operations of $1,053,000 from the acquisition of Reimer Express Lines Ltd.</p>
</text>
